@* Validation in APIs ([ApiController] magic)
[ApiController]
public class ProductsController : ControllerBase
{
    [HttpPost]
    public IActionResult Create(ProductViewModel model)
    {
        // ModelState auto-validated
        return Ok();
    }
}

No need to use ModelState.IsValid check because of [ApiController] attribute
Invalid model → 400 automatically *@